{
  "hooks": ["One more, and then I swear that I am gone"],
  "lines": [
    {
      "bar": 1,
      "beat": 1.25,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "section": "DROP1",
      "text": "Lights cut, and the bass came down in a pour"
    },
    {
      "bar": 2,
      "beat": 1.25,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "section": "DROP1",
      "text": "Half the room gone quiet where the sound tore"
    },
    {
      "bar": 3,
      "beat": 1.25,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "section": "BUILD1",
      "text": "Hands up. Here it comes again."
    },
    {
      "bar": 4,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "section": "TURNAROUND1",
      "text": "Eyes gone red, ache half crossed with fear"
    },
    {
      "bar": 5,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "section": "TURNAROUND1",
      "text": "Thread the brake, and hold what it will cost"
    },
    {
      "bar": 6,
      "beat": 1.75,
      "duration": 3.25,
      "section": "FALSE_ENDING1",
      "text": "And that was almost it. Almost."
    },
    {
      "bar": 7,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "section": "VERSE1",
      "text": "I know the road home and I do not take it"
    },
    {
      "bar": 11,
      "beat": 1.25,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "section": "PRECHORUS1",
      "text": "Somebody counting down behind my teeth"
    },
    {
      "bar": 12,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "section": "CHORUS1",
      "text": "One more, and then I swear that I am gone"
    },
    {
      "bar": 13,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "section": "POSTCHORUS1",
      "text": "Nothing to spare, dry in the mouth again"
    },
    {
      "bar": 14,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "section": "POSTCHORUS1",
      "text": "Down the back stair, morning nigh enough"
    },
    {
      "bar": 15,
      "beat": 1.25,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "section": "TAG1",
      "text": "Say it again. Say it like you mean it."
    },
    {
      "bar": 16,
      "beat": 1.75,
      "duration": 3.25,
      "section": "VAMP1",
      "text": "And the room keeps turning on its heel"
    },
    {
      "bar": 17,
      "beat": 1.25,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "section": "PRECHORUS2",
      "text": "Somebody counting up now, and it's late"
    },
    {
      "bar": 18,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "section": "CHORUS2",
      "text": "One more, and then I swear that I am gone"
    },
    {
      "bar": 19,
      "beat": 1.5,
      "duration": 3.5,
      "section": "HOOK1",
      "text": "One more, and the light goes grey"
    },
    {
      "bar": 20,
      "beat": 1.25,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "section": "CODA1",
      "text": "Groan of the crane, heap past quay and dark"
    },
    {
      "bar": 21,
      "beat": 1.25,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "section": "CODA1",
      "text": "Plea, stone under my hand, the light a creep"
    },
    {
      "bar": 22,
      "beat": 1.25,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "section": "CODA1",
      "text": "Flee it or wear it. Dawn in the one bare tree"
    }
  ],
